Welcome to fielddEDU, the free learning series that helps you master running your business.

Learn how to use fielddEngage, the all-new drip marketing suite built inside the fieldd CRM. With automated campaigns triggered by customer behavior, you can send personalized texts and emails to boost bookings and promote services year-round. 

Whether it’s seasonal promos, abandoned bookings, or welcome messages, fielddEngage helps you stay top of mind, without lifting a finger.

Start automating your marketing today and see how simple it is to set up a campaign from scratch or use one of our ready-made templates.

This is how modern service businesses stay fully booked, automatically.

When you’re ready to master your business, we’re here to help. https://fieldd.co

